{
  "title": "显示设置",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>显示设置</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">点击<span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><b>显示图标 <img src=\"/aras-images/display.jpg\"> </b></span>可以查看所选条目的表单或属性。点击<strong>预览</strong>，如下所示：</p>\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 64px;\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width: 21.4%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 21.6%;\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/image1.png\"></p>\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body\">以下是<strong>预览</strong>选项：</p>\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" width=\"65.529%\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"t1st\">\n        <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">菜单选项</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">描述</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><span class=\"Bold\">表单</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">在底部显示所选条目的基本表单视图。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><span class=\"Bold\">属性</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">在主搜索网格左侧显示所选条目属性的基本列表。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><span class=\"Bold\">隐藏</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">隐藏所有预览，仅显示主搜索网格。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><strong>保存布局</strong>选项将当前设置保存为您的首选项。下次打开相同的搜索网格时，显示设置将默认使用已保存的选项。</p>\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Display_Settings.htm"
}